			<section aria-labelledby="academic">
				<h2 id="academic">Guest lectures and academic engagement</h2>
				<p>
					I welcome invitations from universities for guest lectures,
					technical seminars, workshops, and mentoring. Topics I can cover:
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Agentic AI: architecture, evaluation, and responsible autonomy</li>
					<li>Building production-ready AI systems</li>
					<li>Site reliability engineering and operational excellence</li>
					<li>AI-native software engineering and developer productivity</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					My aim is to connect academic foundations with the practical
					problems of building and operating real systems.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="formats">
				<h2 id="formats">Formats</h2>
