					<li>Conference keynotes and technical sessions</li>
					<li>Engineering leadership panels and fireside chats</li>
					<li>Technical workshops</li>
					<li>Podcasts and interviews</li>
					<li>University and research discussions</li>
					<li>Industry roundtables</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="bio">
				<h2 id="bio">Speaker bio</h2>
				<p>
					Ravikumar Buragapu is a Director of Engineering with more
					than 25 years in software engineering. At Oracle Health he
					leads engineering across infrastructure, reliability, and
					data intelligence platforms, with a focus on making agentic
					and generative AI systems secure, observable, and reliable
					in regulated environments. Previously he formed the Agentic
					and GenAI Squad at Wells Fargo and led platform engineering
					and the Agentic AI Builders Group at Adobe. He has spoken at
					DPE Summit, Percona Community Live, and ScyllaDB Summit.
				</p>
				<p><a href="/about">Full background</a></p>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="invite">
